t's a huge bummer but we know  that they have to finish up some filming  which means they'll have to do some  editing as well so it doesn't come as  that big of a surprise but  fortunately we are getting wanda vision  but now of course the question  is when now if you look at the one  division page on disney plus it says  december 2020 however  it is said december of 2020 since  february of this year so  it's not updated which is actually good  news because  disney has already confirmed that we are  getting it in 2020 so that means it  could come  before december so we could get it  earlier and it looks like somebody has  figured  it out new evidence found by the guys  over at murphy's multiverse.com points  to the show being released on november  27th of this year  now how they found this information out  is actually pretty cool  now there's a section of data on each  show and movie page that lists release  dates currently set by the provider  which is disney plus now in this code  murphy's multiverse has found the part  where it says release date and it does  say  november 27th and this was recently  updated on september 18th  right before the trailer for the one  division series went out  and to top it all off they checked the  same data for the mandalorian since the  mandalorians release date has already  been announced and  lo and behold in the data it does say  release date  october 30th 2020 which is the actual  release date that disney announced so  according to this evidence that has been  found it does seem pretty  likely that november 27th is going to be  the release date for the one division  series  and since the one division series was  supposed to air in december of 2020 this  isn't really that far off  november 27th is only three days away  from december so it looks like black  friday could be the release of the one  division series  now another thing that people have been  asking is what about the continuity of  black widow  the falcon in the winter soldier and the  one division series well one of the  potential reasons that the falcon and  the winter soldier could have been  pushed back is the release date of black  widow there have been reports that  marvel studios is considering moving  black widow's release date and many  people do expect that black widow is  going to have some setups for the falcon  and the winter soldier that means that  black widow will indeed have to come out  before  falcon and the winter soldier but as far  as its connection to the one division  series it doesn't look like there's  going to be much  because marvel wouldn't have one  division coming out before black widow  or the falcon and the winter soldier if  it gave anything away  or set anything up all we know right now  is that the wanda vision series  for sure is going to set up the events  of doctor strange and the multiverse of  madness so as far as continuity goes  that's all that really matters at this  point in time so the one division series  coming out before black widow  and before the falcon in the winter  soldier is perfectly fine don't worry  marvel studios knows what they're doing  so bummer to hear about the falcon in  the winter soldier but good news we are  getting the one division series  this year and we could be getting it on  black friday  so be sure to let me know what you think  about this news in the comments down  below don't forget to like the video and  subscribe so you can stay up to date on  all the latest mcu news for live updates  and stupid memes you can follow me on  twitter and  instagram and as always thank you all so  much for watching woof  you
 

